== r3.82 (CANON-5, CANON-9): an enum field without a default has no implicit
== value; it is given in the construction, so a struct declared without one
== is an error.
Type
    TSuit (Club, Diamond, Heart, Spade)
    TCard Struct
        FSuit TSuit
    ;

Main :
    C TCard
    PutLn(C.FSuit)
;
